result.cmd_controller_execute:
{"command": "echo "To check your internet speed, you can use an online speed test or run a command. For example, on Windows PowerShell:

Measure-Command {
    (New-Object System.Net.WebClient).DownloadFile('https://speed.hetzner.de/100MB.bin', 'C:\\temp\\file')
}

This will download a 100MB file and show how long it took. Divide 100MB by the time in seconds to get Mbps. Alternatively, install speedtest-cli via pip and run 'speedtest' in PowerShell.
""}

